                                "value": [ "offset_oncc1=4096", "Sample Playback / offset_onccN   ·   entry 034", "VALUES: int · 0…2147483647 sample frames [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Adds a CC-scaled sample-frame offset to the playback start.", "Requires a real sample; playback start and end must remain inside that file and start must precede end. Use MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.", "// offset_onccN — Sample Playback\n<control>\nset_cc1=64\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_SAMPLE.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 offset_oncc1=4096\n", "Use a sample longer than 24098 frames, adjust offsets/end to fit, and retrigger note 60. For note-start parameters, set MIDI CC 1 before each new note; compare values 0 and 127.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Sample Playback / offset_onccN   ·   entry 034\nVALUES: int · 0…2147483647 sample frames [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Requires a real sample; playback start and end must remain inside that file and start must precede end. Use MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.\nTRY: Use a sample longer than 24098 frames, adjust offsets/end to fit, and retrigger note 60. For note-start parameters, set MIDI CC 1 before each new note; compare values 0 and 127.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
