                                "value": [ "group=1", "Voice Lifecycle / group   ·   entry 043", "VALUES: int · -2147483647…4294967295\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Assigns a voice group used for mutually exclusive playback and group voice limits.", "Choking requires a voice with off_by matching the group of a subsequently triggered voice; use a nonzero group ID. off_time only controls the fade when off_mode=time.", "// group — Voice Lifecycle\n<region>\nsample=*sine pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18 ampeg_release=2 key=60 off_by=1\noff_mode=time off_time=0.4 group=1\n<region>\nsample=*saw lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18 ampeg_release=0.2\nkey=62 group=1 off_by=1\n", "Hold note 60, then play note 62 without releasing 60; the second region chokes the first.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Voice Lifecycle / group   ·   entry 043\nVALUES: int · -2147483647…4294967295\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Choking requires a voice with off_by matching the group of a subsequently triggered voice; use a nonzero group ID. off_time only controls the fade when off_mode=time.\nTRY: Hold note 60, then play note 62 without releasing 60; the second region chokes the first.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
