                            {
                                "key": 47,
                                "value": [ "off_mode=time", "Voice Lifecycle / off_mode   ·   entry 047", "VALUES: fast | normal | time\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Chooses a fast stop, the normal release envelope, or the off_time fade when choked.", "Choking requires a voice with off_by matching the group of a subsequently triggered voice; use a nonzero group ID. off_time only controls the fade when off_mode=time.", "// off_mode — Voice Lifecycle\n<region>\nsample=*sine pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18 ampeg_release=2 key=60 group=1\noff_by=1 off_time=0.4 off_mode=time\n<region>\nsample=*saw lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18 ampeg_release=0.2\nkey=62 group=1 off_by=1\n", "Hold note 60, then play note 62 without releasing 60; the second region chokes the first.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Voice Lifecycle / off_mode   ·   entry 047\nVALUES: fast | normal | time\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Choking requires a voice with off_by matching the group of a subsequently triggered voice; use a nonzero group ID. off_time only controls the fade when off_mode=time.\nTRY: Hold note 60, then play note 62 without releasing 60; the second region chokes the first.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
