                                "value": [ "sw_hilast=25", "MIDI Conditions / sw_hilast   ·   entry 075", "VALUES: note · 0…127\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets the upper bound of a range of last-keyswitch values that enable the region.", "Requires a region with sw_last (or sw_lolast/sw_hilast) and keyswitch note events; sw_default initializes the selection and belongs in <global>/<master>/<group>. sw_label is metadata.", "// sw_hilast — MIDI Conditions\n<global>\nsw_default=24\n<region>\nsample=*sine lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 sw_lolast=24 sw_hilast=25\n", "Tap keyswitch note 24, then play note 60; use a different keyswitch/region to compare articulations.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "MIDI Conditions / sw_hilast   ·   entry 075\nVALUES: note · 0…127\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Requires a region with sw_last (or sw_lolast/sw_hilast) and keyswitch note events; sw_default initializes the selection and belongs in <global>/<master>/<group>. sw_label is metadata.\nTRY: Tap keyswitch note 24, then play note 60; use a different keyswitch/region to compare articulations.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
