                                "value": [ "lorand=0", "Internal Conditions / lorand   ·   entry 080", "VALUES: float · 0…1 [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets the inclusive lower bound of the per-trigger random selection interval.", "Use ordered lorand/hirand bounds; multiple regions with adjacent nonoverlapping intervals create random alternatives.", "// lorand — Internal Conditions\n<region>\nsample=*sine lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 key=60 hirand=0.5 lorand=0\n<region>\nsample=*saw lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 key=60 lorand=0.5 hirand=1\n", "Repeatedly play note 60; either the sine or saw region is selected.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Internal Conditions / lorand   ·   entry 080\nVALUES: float · 0…1 [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Use ordered lorand/hirand bounds; multiple regions with adjacent nonoverlapping intervals create random alternatives.\nTRY: Repeatedly play note 60; either the sine or saw region is selected.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
