                            {
                                "key": 82,
                                "value": [ "seq_length=2", "Internal Conditions / seq_length   ·   entry 082", "VALUES: int · 1…100\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets the number of positions in the round-robin sequence.", "Round robin needs seq_length plus regions with distinct seq_position values on the same key; keep position between 1 and length.", "// seq_length — Internal Conditions\n<group>\nseq_length=2\n<region>\nsample=*sine pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 key=60\nseq_position=1\n<region>\nsample=*saw pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 key=60\nseq_position=2\n", "Repeatedly trigger note 60; the two waveform regions alternate.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Internal Conditions / seq_length   ·   entry 082\nVALUES: int · 1…100\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Round robin needs seq_length plus regions with distinct seq_position values on the same key; keep position between 1 and length.\nTRY: Repeatedly trigger note 60; the two waveform regions alternate.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
                            {
                                "key": 83,
