                            },
                            {
                                "key": 84,
                                "value": [ "trigger=release", "Triggers / trigger   ·   entry 084", "VALUES: attack | release | release_key | first | legato\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Selects note-on, note-off/pedal release, immediate key release, first-note or legato triggering.", "release needs note-off after an attack note; release_key responds to key release. first/legato need the corresponding held-note context. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.", "// trigger — Triggers\n<region>\nsample=*sine lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 key=60\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_RELEASE.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 key=60 rt_dead=on trigger=release\n", "Replace the release-sample filename, play note 60 and release it; the release region then sounds.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Triggers / trigger   ·   entry 084\nVALUES: attack | release | release_key | first | legato\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: release needs note-off after an attack note; release_key responds to key release. first/legato need the corresponding held-note context. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.\nTRY: Replace the release-sample filename, play note 60 and release it; the release region then sounds.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
                            {
                                "key": 85,
                                "value": [ "on_locc1=64", "Triggers / on_loccN   ·   entry 085", "VALUES: float · 0…127 [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets the lower CC-event value that directly triggers this region.", "Pair the low/high CC-trigger thresholds for the same CC; use a finite one-shot sample. key=−1 disables ordinary note triggering. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.", "// on_loccN — Triggers\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_ONE_SHOT.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 key=-1 loop_mode=one_shot on_hicc1=127\non_locc1=64\n", "Replace the filename, then send midievent 176 1 100 to trigger the sample without a MIDI note.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Triggers / on_loccN   ·   entry 085\nVALUES: float · 0…127 [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Pair the low/high CC-trigger thresholds for the same CC; use a finite one-shot sample. key=−1 disables ordinary note triggering. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.\nTRY: Replace the filename, then send midievent 176 1 100 to trigger the sample without a MIDI note.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
