                            },
                            {
                                "key": 157,
                                "value": [ "pitch_oncc1=300", "Pitch / pitch_onccN   ·   entry 157", "VALUES: float · -12000…12000 cents [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for pitch.", "A playable region and note event are sufficient; related parameters use their engine defaults unless the example sets them explicitly. Use MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>.", "// pitch_onccN — Pitch\n<control>\nset_cc1=64\n<region>\nsample=*sine lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 pitch_oncc1=300\n", "Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Pitch / pitch_onccN   ·   entry 157\nVALUES: float · -12000…12000 cents [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: A playable region and note event are sufficient; related parameters use their engine defaults unless the example sets them explicitly. Use MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
                            {
                                "key": 158,
