                            },
                            {
                                "key": 160,
                                "value": [ "pitch_curvecc1=10", "Pitch / pitch_curveccN   ·   entry 160", "VALUES: int · 0…255\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of pitch.", "A playable region and note event are sufficient; related parameters use their engine defaults unless the example sets them explicitly. Requires a nonzero pitch_oncc1 amount using the same CC; smoothing/stepping/curve selection alone does not assign a modulation destination.", "// pitch_curveccN — Pitch\n<control>\nset_cc1=64\n<curve>\ncurve_index=10 v0=0 v64=0.2 v127=1\n<region>\nsample=*sine lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 pitch_oncc1=300 pitch_curvecc1=10\n", "Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Pitch / pitch_curveccN   ·   entry 160\nVALUES: int · 0…255\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: A playable region and note event are sufficient; related parameters use their engine defaults unless the example sets them explicitly. Requires a nonzero pitch_oncc1 amount using the same CC; smoothing/stepping/curve selection alone does not assign a modulation destination.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
                            {
