                                "key": 166,
                                "value": [ "pitch_keycenter=60", "Pitch / pitch_keycenter   ·   entry 166", "VALUES: note · 0…127 or C−1…G9; sample\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets the key at which the sample plays untransposed, or reads its embedded root note.", "pitch_keycenter supplies the reference and pitch_keytrack the cents-per-key slope; use a real pitched sample to assess root-note tuning. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.", "// pitch_keycenter — Pitch\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_PITCHED_SAMPLE.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 pitch_keycenter=60\n", "Use a sample whose root is known; compare notes 60 and 72.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Pitch / pitch_keycenter   ·   entry 166\nVALUES: note · 0…127 or C−1…G9; sample\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: pitch_keycenter supplies the reference and pitch_keytrack the cents-per-key slope; use a real pitched sample to assess root-note tuning. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.\nTRY: Use a sample whose root is known; compare notes 60 and 72.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
