                                "value": [ "eg1_position=75", "Flexible envelopes / egN_position   ·   entry 330", "VALUES: float · -200…200 % [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Sets envelope N modulation depth for stereo position.", "Needs defined time/level points and an audible destination depth (eg1_pitch/cutoff/etc.), or eg1_ampeg=1 to replace the normal amplitude envelope; sustain waits for note-off. Use a stereo sample to hear width/image processing clearly. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.", "// egN_position — Flexible envelopes\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_STEREO.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 eg1_time0=0 eg1_level0=0 eg1_time1=0.5\neg1_level1=1 eg1_time2=0.5 eg1_level2=0.4 eg1_sustain=2 eg1_time3=0.7\neg1_level3=0 eg1_position=75\n", "Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Flexible envelopes / egN_position   ·   entry 330\nVALUES: float · -200…200 % [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Needs defined time/level points and an audible destination depth (eg1_pitch/cutoff/etc.), or eg1_ampeg=1 to replace the normal amplitude envelope; sustain waits for note-off. Use a stereo sample to hear width/image processing clearly. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
                            {
