nto sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
