                                "value": [ "lfo1_cutoff_smoothcc1=80", "Flexible LFOs / lfoN_cutoff_smoothccX   ·   entry 409", "VALUES: int · 0…100 ms [P↑]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)", "Smooths CC X changes to LFO N modulation depth for filter cutoff.", "Requires lfo1_freq>0 and at least one nonzero destination depth such as lfo1_pitch; waveform/timing settings alone assign no destination. The CC-shaping modifier also needs lfo1_cutoff_oncc1; by itself it creates no CC depth. The destination filter must exist with a nonzero cutoff.", "// lfoN_cutoff_smoothccX — Flexible LFOs\n<control>\nset_cc1=64\n<region>\nsample=*saw lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 lfo1_freq=4 lfo1_wave=1 lfo1_cutoff=2400\nlfo1_cutoff_oncc1=2400 fil_type=lpf_2p cutoff=600 resonance=6\nlfo1_cutoff_smoothcc1=80\n", "Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Flexible LFOs / lfoN_cutoff_smoothccX   ·   entry 409\nVALUES: int · 0…100 ms [P↑]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Requires lfo1_freq>0 and at least one nonzero destination depth such as lfo1_pitch; waveform/timing settings alone assign no destination. The CC-shaping modifier also needs lfo1_cutoff_oncc1; by itself it creates no CC depth. The destination filter must exist with a nonzero cutoff.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Ma