                                "value": [ "bus=fx1", "Effects / bus   ·   entry 452", "VALUES: main | fx1…fx256 [B]\nSCOPE: <effect> (effect1…effect4 themselves belong in <region>)", "In <effect>, chooses the effect bus; main is the default and fxN receives effectN sends.", "Requires <effect> type=fverb, bus=fx1, a region effect1 send, and a nonzero fx1tomain return. Parameters after <effect> affect that processor; send opcodes remain under <region>. Changing bus requires changing the matching region effectN send and fxNtomain return as well.", "// bus — Effects\n<effect>\ntype=fverb bus=fx1 reverb_size=80 reverb_wet=100 reverb_dry=0 fx1tomain=100\ndirecttomain=0\n<region>\nsample=*saw lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25 effect1=100\n", "Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release.", "Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.", "Effects / bus   ·   entry 452\nVALUES: main | fx1…fx256 [B]\nSCOPE: <effect> (effect1…effect4 themselves belong in <region>)\nREQUIRES: Requires <effect> type=fverb, bus=fx1, a region effect1 send, and a nonzero fx1tomain return. Parameters after <effect> affect that processor; send opcodes remain under <region>. Changing bus requires changing the matching region effectN send and fxNtomain return as well.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build." ]
                            },
