                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "menu-2",
                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Sets the total sample plays and forces one_shot; in this engine 0 and 1 both play once.  [count]", ",", "Waits this long after a trigger before starting the sample.  [delay]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled delay before the sample starts.  [delay_ccN]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled delay before the sample starts.  [delay_onccN]", ",", "Adds a random start delay from zero up to this amount.  [delay_random]", ",", "Sets the last sample-frame position used for playback; 0 disables playback.  [end]", ",", "Limits additional loop repetitions; 0 prevents repeats; while omitting the opcode leaves looping unlimited.  [loop_count]", ",", "Sets the crossfade duration across the loop boundary; effective length is sample-dependent.  [loop_crossfade]", ",", "Sets the loop end position in sample frames.  [loop_end]", ",", "Sets the loop end position in sample frames.  [loopend]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled offset to the loop end point (engine maps this to loop_end_onccN).  [loop_lengthccN]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled offset to the loop end point (engine maps this to loop_end_onccN).  [loop_length_onccN]", ",", "Selects unlooped; note-off-ignoring one-shot; continuous-loop or held-note-loop playback.  [loop_mode]", ",", "Selects unlooped; note-off-ignoring one-shot; continuous-loop or held-note-loop playback.  [loopmode]", ",", "Sets the loop start position in sample frames.  [loop_start]", ",", "Sets the loop start position in sample frames.  [loopstart]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled offset to the loop start point.  [loop_startccN]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled offset to the loop start point.  [loop_start_onccN]", ",", "Sets the starting sample-frame position; values must remain within the sample.  [offset]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled sample-frame offset to the playback start.  [offset_ccN]", ",", "Adds a CC-scaled sample-frame offset to the playback start.  [offset_onccN]", ",", "Adds a random sample-frame offset to the playback start.  [offset_random]", ",", "Selects the sample file (relative to the SFZ/default_path); or a supported built-in generator.  [sample]", ",", "Selects forward or reverse sample playback.  [direction]" ],
