                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "menu-4",
                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Assigns a voice group used for mutually exclusive playback and group voice limits.  [group]", ",", "Assigns a voice group used for mutually exclusive playback and group voice limits.  [polyphony_group]", ",", "Makes this region stop when a new voice in the specified group is triggered.  [off_by]", ",", "Makes this region stop when a new voice in the specified group is triggered.  [offby]", ",", "Chooses a fast stop; the normal release envelope; or the off_time fade when choked.  [off_mode]", ",", "Routes the region to stereo pair 0=outlets 1/2; 1=3/4; etc.; set Max @outputs accordingly.  [output]", ",", "Limits simultaneous voices in its scope; the engine ceiling and Max @voices also apply.  [polyphony]", ",", "Limits simultaneous voices at the same pitch; the engine ceiling and Max @voices also apply.  [note_polyphony]", ",", "Chooses whether a softer repeated note can steal a louder voice under note_polyphony.  [note_selfmask]", ",", "Allows a release-trigger region even after the corresponding attack voice has ended.  [rt_dead]", ",", "Sets the choke-fade duration when off_mode=time.  [off_time]" ],
