                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "menu-5",
                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Requires the last value of CC N to be at least this threshold when a note arrives.  [loccN]", ",", "Requires the last value of CC N to be at most this threshold when a note arrives.  [hiccN]", ",", "Sets the lower pitch-bend condition for triggering the region.  [lobend]", ",", "Sets the upper pitch-bend condition for triggering the region.  [hibend]", ",", "Chooses the MIDI controller number used as the sostenuto pedal.  [sostenuto_cc]", ",", "Sets the controller threshold at which the sostenuto pedal counts as down.  [sostenuto_lo]", ",", "Chooses the MIDI controller number used as the sustain pedal.  [sustain_cc]", ",", "Sets the controller threshold at which the sustain pedal counts as down.  [sustain_lo]", ",", "Enables or disables sustain-pedal behavior for this region.  [sustain_sw]", ",", "Declared keyswitch range; the inspected engine accepts these names but ignores their values.  [sw_lokey]", ",", "Declared keyswitch range; the inspected engine accepts these names but ignores their values.  [sw_hikey]", ",", "Enables the region when this key is the most recently selected keyswitch.  [sw_last]", ",", "Enables the region only while the specified keyswitch is held.  [sw_down]", ",", "Enables the region only while the specified keyswitch is released.  [sw_up]", ",", "Enables the region if the preceding note-on had this note number.  [sw_previous]", ",", "Uses the current note velocity or the velocity retained from the keyswitch.  [sw_vel]", ",", "Sets the lower controller condition with normalized high-resolution values.  [lohdccN]", ",", "Sets the upper controller condition with normalized high-resolution values.  [hihdccN]", ",", "Sets the initially selected keyswitch.  [sw_default]", ",", "Names a keyswitch in instrument metadata; Max does not automatically display it.  [sw_label]", ",", "Sets the lower bound of a range of last-keyswitch values that enable the region.  [sw_lolast]", ",", "Sets the upper bound of a range of last-keyswitch values that enable the region.  [sw_hilast]" ],
