                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "menu-8",
                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Balances the region left (−100); center (0) or right (+100).  [pan]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for pan position.  [pan_onccN]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for pan position.  [pan_ccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of pan position.  [pan_curveccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to pan position over this time.  [pan_smoothccN]", ",", "Quantizes CC N modulation of pan position; 0 means continuous changes.  [pan_stepccN]", ",", "Places the stereo image after width processing; −100 is left and +100 is right.  [position]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for stereo position.  [position_onccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of stereo position.  [position_curveccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to stereo position over this time.  [position_smoothccN]", ",", "Quantizes CC N modulation of stereo position; 0 means continuous changes.  [position_stepccN]", ",", "Sets the region gain in decibels; 0 dB leaves its level unchanged.  [volume]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for gain in dB.  [gain_ccN]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for gain in dB.  [gain_onccN]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for gain in dB.  [volume_onccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of gain in dB.  [volume_curveccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to gain in dB over this time.  [volume_smoothccN]", ",", "Quantizes CC N modulation of gain in dB; 0 means continuous changes.  [volume_stepccN]", ",", "Sets stereo width; 0 collapses to mono; 100 is normal and −100 swaps channels.  [width]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for stereo width.  [width_onccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of stereo width.  [width_curveccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to stereo width over this time.  [width_smoothccN]", ",", "Quantizes CC N modulation of stereo width; 0 means continuous changes.  [width_stepccN]", ",", "Sets the reference key for amplitude key tracking.  [amp_keycenter]", ",", "Changes amplitude by this many dB per semitone from amp_keycenter.  [amp_keytrack]", ",", "Sets velocity-to-amplitude tracking; 0 removes the usual velocity-dependent level.  [amp_veltrack]", ",", "Sets amplitude at velocity point N (N=0…127); with interpolation between defined points.  [amp_velcurve_N]", ",", "Sets the amount of per-voice random gain variation in dB.  [amp_random]", ",", "Attenuates release-trigger samples according to elapsed time since the attack note.  [rt_decay]", ",", "Selects a linear-gain or equal-power curve for controller; key or velocity crossfades.  [xf_cccurve]", ",", "Selects a linear-gain or equal-power curve for controller; key or velocity crossfades.  [xf_keycurve]", ",", "Selects a linear-gain or equal-power curve for controller; key or velocity crossfades.  [xf_velcurve]", ",", "Sets the lower controller endpoint of the region fade-in interval.  [xfin_loccN]", ",", "Sets the upper controller endpoint of the region fade-in interval.  [xfin_hiccN]", ",", "Sets the lower controller endpoint of the region fade-out interval.  [xfout_loccN]", ",", "Sets the upper controller endpoint of the region fade-out interval.  [xfout_hiccN]", ",", "Sets the lower key endpoint of the region fade-in interval.  [xfin_lokey]", ",", "Sets the upper key endpoint of the region fade-in interval.  [xfin_hikey]", ",", "Sets the lower key endpoint of the region fade-out interval.  [xfout_lokey]", ",", "Sets the upper key endpoint of the region fade-out interval.  [xfout_hikey]", ",", "Sets the lower velocity endpoint of the region fade-in interval.  [xfin_lovel]", ",", "Sets the upper velocity endpoint of the region fade-in interval.  [xfin_hivel]", ",", "Sets the lower velocity endpoint of the region fade-out interval.  [xfout_lovel]", ",", "Sets the upper velocity endpoint of the region fade-out interval.  [xfout_hivel]", ",", "Sets linear region gain as a percentage; 100% is unity.  [amplitude]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for linear amplitude.  [amplitude_onccN]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for linear amplitude.  [amplitude_ccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of linear amplitude.  [amplitude_curveccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to linear amplitude over this time.  [amplitude_smoothccN]", ",", "Applies an additional linear gain factor for the named hierarchy level.  [global_amplitude]", ",", "Applies an additional linear gain factor for the named hierarchy level.  [master_amplitude]", ",", "Applies an additional linear gain factor for the named hierarchy level.  [group_amplitude]", ",", "Applies an additional decibel gain for the named hierarchy level.  [global_volume]", ",", "Applies an additional decibel gain for the named hierarchy level.  [master_volume]", ",", "Applies an additional decibel gain for the named hierarchy level.  [group_volume]" ],
