                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Sets the pitch displacement at maximum upward pitch bend.  [bend_up]", ",", "Sets the pitch displacement at maximum upward pitch bend.  [bendup]", ",", "Sets the pitch displacement at maximum downward pitch bend.  [bend_down]", ",", "Sets the pitch displacement at maximum downward pitch bend.  [benddown]", ",", "Sets the pitch-bend smoothing time in milliseconds.  [bend_smooth]", ",", "Quantizes pitch-bend movement to this interval in cents.  [bend_step]", ",", "Quantizes pitch-bend movement to this interval in cents.  [bendstep]", ",", "Offsets sample pitch in cents without changing its key assignment.  [tune]", ",", "Offsets sample pitch in cents without changing its key assignment.  [pitch]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for pitch.  [pitch_onccN]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for pitch.  [tune_ccN]", ",", "Sets the CC N modulation amount for pitch.  [tune_onccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of pitch.  [pitch_curveccN]", ",", "Selects the response curve for CC N modulation of pitch.  [tune_curveccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to pitch over this time.  [pitch_smoothccN]", ",", "Smooths CC N changes to pitch over this time.  [tune_smoothccN]", ",", "Quantizes CC N modulation of pitch; 0 means continuous changes.  [pitch_stepccN]", ",", "Quantizes CC N modulation of pitch; 0 means continuous changes.  [tune_stepccN]", ",", "Sets the key at which the sample plays untransposed; or reads its embedded root note.  [pitch_keycenter]", ",", "Sets pitch tracking per keyboard semitone; 100 is ordinary chromatic playback.  [pitch_keytrack]", ",", "Sets pitch tracking per keyboard semitone; 100 is ordinary chromatic playback.  [tune_keytrack]", ",", "Sets the amount of per-voice random pitch variation.  [pitch_random]", ",", "Sets the amount of per-voice random pitch variation.  [tune_random]", ",", "Sets velocity-dependent pitch displacement in cents.  [pitch_veltrack]", ",