                    "bgfillcolor_color2": [ 0.2, 0.2, 0.2, 1 ],
                    "bgfillcolor_type": "color",
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "menu-21",
                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Sets the depth of the autopan effect.  [apan_depth]", ",", "Sets the dry or processed autopan contribution in percent.  [apan_dry]", ",", "Sets the autopan LFO rate; the engine accepts any nonnegative finite Hz value.  [apan_freq]", ",", "Sets the phase separation between the left and right autopan LFOs.  [apan_phase]", ",", "Sets the dry or processed autopan contribution in percent.  [apan_wet]", ",", "Sets the bit-depth reduction amount in a type=lofi effect.  [bitred]", ",", "In <effect>; chooses the effect bus; main is the default and fxN receives effectN sends.  [bus]", ",", "Sets compressor attack time.  [comp_attack]", ",", "Sets compressor makeup gain.  [comp_gain]", ",", "Sets compressor ratio; 1 is no compression.  [comp_ratio]", ",", "Sets compressor release time.  [comp_release]", ",", "Links or separates compressor detection for left and right channels.  [comp_stlink]", ",", "Sets the level above which compression acts.  [comp_threshold]", ",", "Sets the sample-rate reduction amount in a type=lofi effect.  [decim]", ",", "Sets the main bus contribution to its output pair in percent.  [directtomain]", ",", "In a region; sends this percentage of its signal to the corresponding effect bus.  [effect1]", ",", "In a region; sends this percentage of its signal to the corresponding effect bus.  [effect2]", ",", "In a region; sends this percentage of its signal to the corresponding effect bus.  [effect3]", ",", "In a region; sends this percentage of its signal to the corresponding effect bus.  [effect4]", ",", "Sets bandwidth of the equalizer effect in octaves.  [eq_bw]", ",", "Sets center frequency of the equalizer effect.  [eq_freq]", ",", "Sets gain of the equalizer effect.  [eq_gain]", ",", "Sets cutoff/center frequency of the filter effect.  [filter_cutoff]", ",", "Sets resonance of the filter effect.  [filter_resonance]", ",", "Selects the topology of a type=filter effect.  [filter_type]", ",", "Sets effect bus N contribution to its output pair; N=1…256 in upstream code [B].  [fxNtomain]", ",", "Sets gate opening time.  [gate_attack]", ",", "Sets gate closing time.  [gate_release]", ",", "Links or separates the gate detectors for left and right channels.  [gate_stlink]", ",", "Sets the level at which the gate opens.  [gate_threshold]", ",", "Sets high-frequency damping within the reverb tail.  [reverb_damp]", ",", "Sets the dry; wet or input level of the fverb effect; respectively.  [reverb_dry]", ",", "Sets the dry; wet or input level of the fverb effect; respectively.  [reverb_input]", ",", "Sets the delay before the reverberated sound begins.  [reverb_predelay]", ",", "Sets the modeled size of the reverb space.  [reverb_size]", ",", "Sets the tonal control of the fverb effect.  [reverb_tone]", ",", "Chooses one of the fverb reverberation profiles.  [reverb_type]", ",", "Sets the dry; wet or input level of the fverb effect; respectively.  [reverb_wet]", ",", "Sets the number of modeled strings in the sympathetic-resonance effect.  [strings_number]", ",", "In <effect>; selects an implemented effect processor; this is not a region opcode.  [type]", ",", "TABLE DISCREPANCY: source expects sfizz:filter_gain for shelf/peak gain in <effect>.  [filter_gain]", ",", "Sets the processed contribution of the sympathetic-resonance effect.  [strings_wet]", ",", "Selects full-wave or half-wave rectification in a type=rectify effect.  [rectify_mode]", ",", "Sets the proportion of rectified signal mixed into the effect output.  [rectify]", ",", "Sets decibel gain in a type=gain effect; upstream source uses the volume specification.  [gain]", ",", "Sets stereo width in a type=width effect; 0 is mono and negative values reverse the image.  [width]", ",", "Sets how long the gate stays open after the signal drops below threshold.  [gate_hold]" ],
                    "maxclass": "umenu",
