                    "items": [ "Choose an opcode…", ",", "Selects automatic; forced-on or forced-off wavetable oscillator playback.  [oscillator]", ",", "Sets detuning among the voices of a multi-oscillator region.  [oscillator_detune]", ",", "Uses CC N to change the multi-oscillator detuning amount.  [oscillator_detune_onccN]", ",", "Selects normal/ring (0) or modulation (1/2); modes 1 and 2 both run FM in the inspected engine.  [oscillator_mode]", ",", "Sets the oscillator phase/frequency modulation depth.  [oscillator_mod_depth]", ",", "Uses CC N to change the oscillator modulation depth.  [oscillator_mod_depth_onccN]", ",", "Sets the number of oscillator instances within a voice; upstream ceiling is 9 [B].  [oscillator_multi]", ",", "Sets initial oscillator phase in cycle fractions in sfizz; rather than degrees.  [oscillator_phase]", ",", "Selects oscillator quality from 0 through 3.  [oscillator_quality]" ],
