                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 66.0, 1230.0, 23.0 ],
                                    "text": "507 entries • 24 menu categories • dependency notes included • one scrollable index canvas",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "bgcolor": [ 0.98, 0.91, 0.76, 1.0 ],
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-4",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 102.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Scope: all 503 entries marked supported in the sfizz table linked by Cycling ’74, including aliases and the two uses of width. This is a documented compatibility index, not a runtime-certified inventory for every\nMax 9 build. Ranges are cross-checked against upstream sfizz commit f5c6e29f23b8; differences are flagged.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-5",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 156.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "HOW TO READ • Enter SFZ as opcode=value in an instrument file/dictionary; these are not automatically Max inlet messages. int means integer; float accepts decimals; s means seconds. Scroll this single\npage; use Max Find (Cmd/Ctrl+F) for an opcode or heading. All content is native Max comments, with no external dependencies.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "bgcolor": [ 0.925, 0.939, 0.934, 1.0 ],
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-6",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 206.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "LIMITS • Unmarked ranges are engine input bounds. [P] is a nominal range: the parser also accepts values outside both ends; [P↑] permits values above the upper end. Such values can still be clipped or limited\nlater by the DSP. [B] depends on the embedded build. [!] is a known discrepancy or behavior caveat. [S] is an upstream-source supplement.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-7",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 256.0, 1230.0, 50.0 ],
                                    "text": "INDEX LETTERS • ccN/ccX/ccY: replace the final letter with a MIDI CC number, normally 0…127; the upstream engine has slots 0…511, including internal/extended controllers that are not ordinary MIDI CC\nbytes. egN/lfoN: N≥1; no fixed upper cap is enforced in the inspected parser (keep counts practical). Point X≥0, subwave X=1…8, LFO step X=1…128; EQ/filter indices normally start at 1. Each letter position is\nindependent.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
