                                    "text": "Sets CC X control of envelope N modulation depth for filter X gain. The final X is a\nseparate CC index. Dependencies: Needs defined time/level points and an audible\ndestination depth (eg1_pitch/cutoff/etc.), or eg1_ampeg=1 to replace the normal\namplitude envelope; sustain waits for note-off. Filter gain needs a shelf/peaking filter type.\nUse MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in\n<control>.",
