                                    "text": "Sets stereo width in a type=width effect; 0 is mono and negative values reverse the\nimage. Dependencies: Requires <effect> type=width, bus=fx1, a region effect1 send, and\na nonzero fx1tomain return. Parameters after <effect> affect that processor; send\nopcodes remain under <region>. Use a genuinely stereo sample; width does not create\nan audible width change from identical mono channels. Replace every\nREPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.",
