                                    "text": "Uses CC N to change the oscillator modulation depth. Dependencies: Requires an\noscillator source (built-in waveform or sample forced into oscillator mode). Detune needs\nmultiple oscillator instances; modulation depth needs oscillator_mode=1 or 2. Use MIDI\nCC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>.",
