                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 720.0, 42454.0, 535.0, 65.0 ],
                                    "text": "In <curve>, sets point N; the engine linearly interpolates unspecified points.\nDependencies: A curve needs curve_index and point values, plus a supported\ndestination_curveccN and a nonzero destination_onccN amount using that same curve\nindex.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ],
