                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "bgcolor": [ 0.967, 0.965, 0.95, 1.0 ],
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1672",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 328.0, 42666.0, 384.0, 21.0 ],
                                    "text": "float · −96…96 dB [P] [S]",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ],
                                    "varname": "index_507_1"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "bgcolor": [ 0.967, 0.965, 0.95, 1.0 ],
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1673",
                                    "linecount": 4,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 720.0, 42666.0, 535.0, 65.0 ],
                                    "text": "In <effect> type=filter, sets shelf/peak gain; this is the implemented spelling behind\nfilter_gain. Dependencies: Requires <effect> type=filter, bus=fx1, a region effect1 send,\nand a nonzero fx1tomain return. Parameters after <effect> affect that processor; send\nopcodes remain under <region>.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ],
                                    "varname": "index_507_2"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "bgcolor": [ 0.12, 0.23, 0.29, 1.0 ],
                                    "fontface": 1,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 17.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1674",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 24.0, 42772.0, 1242.0, 25.0 ],
                                    "text": "SOURCES, BUILD LIMITS & USE NOTES",
                                    "textcolor": [ 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1675",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 42818.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Completeness rule: the main index includes all 503 checked rows of the published support table captured on 24 October 2026; no unchecked or work-in-progress rows are presented as certified Max features.\nThe upstream code implements additional features absent from that table. Exact acceptance in an installed Max binary needs version-specific testing; this file makes no claim to have run Max.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1676",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 42870.0, 1230.0, 21.0 ],
                                    "text": "Published table: https://sfz.tools/sfizz/development/status/opcodes/ (mirror: https://sfztools.github.io/sfizz/development/status/opcodes/). Max object reference: https://docs.cycling74.com/reference/sfizz~/ .",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1677",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 42905.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Engine source: https://github.com/sfztools/sfizz/tree/f5c6e29f23b8057867c08e88f5f6ac6738baa30b/src/sfizz — Defaults.cpp, Opcode.cpp, Region.cpp, Synth.cpp, Effects.cpp and individual effects. General\ndefinitions: https://sfzformat.com/opcodes/ (SFZ Format team; CC0).",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1678",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 42957.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Build-dependent limits: upstream default maximum voices=256, oscillator instances/voice=9, effect bus indices=1…256, CC slots=0…511. These are not asserted as Max binary limits. Cycling ’74 explicitly\ndocuments Max @outputs=2…1024 and stereo output opcode indices up to 511.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1679",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 43009.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Use SFZ key numbers to avoid octave-label ambiguity. Numeric ranges describe values after the equals sign; the numeric indices inside opcode names have separate limits. Frame positions also need to fit the\nactual audio file. CC modulation needs a nonzero depth and the relevant MIDI event; filter/effect parameters need the appropriate filter/effect to exist.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1680",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 43061.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Engine caveats: sw_lokey/sw_hikey are ignored in the inspected region parser; metadata such as image and labels does not create a Max GUI; filter_gain in the table is implemented as sfizz:filter_gain in\n<effect>; oscillator modes 1/2 share the FM implementation. Unsupported fields may not generate an obvious audible result.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1681",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 43113.0, 1230.0, 36.0 ],
                                    "text": "Validation: native .maxpat JSON, exact published-table coverage, unique object IDs, complete value/description cells, font-metric layout checks and static visual inspection. Max itself was unavailable for runtime\nverification. All 507 rows are on this one root canvas; no subpatchers, scripts, sample files or third-party externals are required.",
                                    "textcolor": [ 0.12, 0.18, 0.24, 1.0 ]
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 1,
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 14.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1682",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
